{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41485","headline":"岁暮晚泊望庐山不见因怀岳僧呈察判 · 李建勳","name":"岁暮晚泊望庐山不见因怀岳僧呈察判","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贪程只爲看庐阜，及到停舟恨颇浓。\n云暗半空藏万仞，雪迷双瀑在中峯。\n林端莫辨曾游路，鸟际微闻向暮钟。\n长愧昔年招我入，共寻香社见芙蓉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41485.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41485","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}